Now in game:
  - correct operation of the store, details, receipt of vehicle;
  - fixed work of bots, now the battles will be more dynamic;
  - a simplified game mode appeared in the graphics settings of the game (mobile version of the game, only with PC control). This mode is globally optimized and simplified;
  - in the hangar you can see the "Manual" for controlling vehicle in the game;
  - there was a warning that the fuel is running out and there is no ammunition.
There will also be an update on Android soon.
We hope you enjoy the update)
